# The `standalone` build target bakes artefacts into the image instead of
# mounting them, which is what makes an App Service Free (F1) deployment
# possible -- see deploy/README.md section 6. Only the four paths the serving
# path actually reads are un-ignored; everything else above still applies.
#
# This costs ~110 MB of build context on every build, including the default
# `runtime` target that does not copy them. That is the price of one Dockerfile
# rather than two that drift apart.
!models/**
!data/raw/**
!data/interim/**
!data/processed/**
